Third-party notices and disclaimer:
- Rewipe is an unofficial, fan-made tool. It is not affiliated with, authorised, sponsored or endorsed by SQUARE ENIX CO., LTD. or any regional operator of FINAL FANTASY XIV. FINAL FANTASY, FINAL FANTASY XIV, FFXIV and related names and images are trademarks or registered trademarks of the Square Enix group; in-game text, names and other content are copyright of their respective owners.
- Rewipe does not contain or distribute game data files. Action, status and duty names shown on screen are read on the user's own computer from the user's installed game client, from the user's own combat logs, or from data provided by FFLogs.
- Rewipe does not modify the game program or game files, does not read or write the game's memory, and does not intercept or alter the game's network traffic.
- Advanced Combat Tracker (ACT), FFXIV_ACT_Plugin, OverlayPlugin, RivaTuner Statistics Server (RTSS) and FFLogs are software and services of their respective authors or companies. Rewipe does not include them, is not affiliated with them and is not endorsed by them; it only reads data produced by those programs after the user has installed them, or data the user obtains from those services with the user's own key. Follow their respective terms when using them.
